Do you want the freedom of temporary work and the security of permanent employment? For 30 years we have supported hundreds of companies in the technical sectors of building, construction and industry throughout Switzerland, offering them the best talent. However, we don't hide from you that we are demanding. So, if you are a motivated and extremely enthusiastic person, join our team for the position of AFC Electrician Installer ## Your assignment:
• Carry out electrical connections on new construction and renovation sites;
• Carry out changes and adjustments to the electrical panels;
• Intervene on systems relating to heat pumps (PAC);
• Create the AC systems of the photovoltaic systems;
• Participate in the commissioning of the systems;
• Provide timely support on the direct current (DC) part of photovoltaic systems;
• Work autonomously, while collaborating effectively with field teams. ## And now let's talk a little about you?
• In possession of an AFC (Federal Certificate of Skill) as an electrician installer or training deemed equivalent
• Driving license essential
• Proven experience in electrical connections, electrical panels, heat pumps and photovoltaic systems in Switzerland
• Independent person, organized and attentive to the quality of the work carried out
• Good team spirit, sense of responsibility and proactive attitude ## Your contact person: Your contact person for this position is Laetitia. They will be able to accompany you, advise you and answer all your questions relating to the position. This job isn't exactly what you're looking for, but do our values ​​interest you? Don't hesitate to send us your spontaneous application! We will only respond to applications whose profile matches the requested description.

